./logs/iter_002_solver.stderr.log:338:Thus sublinear uniform regret follows if there are schedules \(H_T,K_T\) with \(H_T\log K_T=o(T)\), \(T/K_T=o(T)\), and uniform truncation loss \(o(T)\). For power tails \(\Delta_T(H)\le T H^{-\alpha}\), the existing proof gives rate \(T^{(\alpha+1)/(2\alpha+1)}(\log T)^{\alpha/(2\alpha+1)}\) with \(K=T\).
