\[
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r_t(a)\right]
    \leq
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r^H_t(a)\right]
    +
    T\beta(H).
\]
Since this holds for every fixed quote \(a\),
\[
    \max_{a \in [0,1]}
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r_t(a)\right]
    \leq
    \max_{a \in [0,1]}
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r^H_t(a)\right]
    +
    T\beta(H).
\]

On the other hand, along every realized path we have
